# Finora agent workflow

- Prefer minimal, targeted diffs. Match existing patterns.
- After behavioral fixes (especially money, WA, alerts): add or extend unit tests that would have failed on the bug.
- Do not commit unless the user asks.
- Long-lived workers (`finora-vira`, `finora.service`) cache modules — schema/enum changes need a service restart, not only a code edit.
- Secrets stay in `.env*`; never commit them.
